    "body": "FF9 now uses Lexeditor's shared mod-project manager. **New Mod** creates a valid StreamingAssets/Data project from the packaged starter, **Find a Mod** validates the same Memoria layout, and project switches restart the FF9 service with the selected path. Auto-discovery, FF9 checks and smoke tests, project creation, the hidden rendered editor, and the full hidden FF8-to-FF9 host switch passed. The remaining p0data, enemy, encounter, runtime, and in-game boundaries are unchanged.",
